  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ethiopian Nationwide Broadcast Television Digitalization, through GatesAir, Inc.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This training grant is supporting the U.S. company GatesAir, Incorporated&apos;s bid to provide equipment and services to the Ethiopian Ministry of Communications and Information Technology (MCIT) that are required for the second phase of Ethiopia&apos;s digital broadcast migration, which will upgrade the terrestrial television service in the country from analog to digital technology. Implementation of the Project would help Ethiopia to meet requirements under the United Nations International Telecommunication Union (ITU) 2006 treaty agreement identifying June 17, 2015 as the deadline for member states to transition from analog to digital broadcasting.</narrative>
  </description>
